<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Faulding to bid for U.S. unit.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Faulding to bid for U.S. unit.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian pharmaceutical group F H Faulding &amp; Co Ltd said it planned to make a US12 a share merger offer for its listed U.S. subsidiary, Faulding Inc.</p>
<p>Faulding said it will fund the merger by means of a rights issue. It gave no details of the issue.</p>
</text>
